# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:3
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_Rev_33e02ec9:

    # VES @ talk "I plan to set up some perimeter defences, just some bells and such on a wire that will jingle in case anyone tries to sneak in here."
    VES @ talk "我打算设置一些周边防御，就是在电线上挂些铃铛之类的东西，如果有人想偷偷溜进来，就会叮当作响。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:9
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_Rev_f515fabb:

    # VES @ talk "... Oh, well, let me know when you’re able to, I suppose..."
    VES @ talk "...哦，好吧，等你有空的时候告诉我吧，我想..."
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:15
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_94bfba8b:

    # VES @ talk "Great, let me get the stuff ready..."
    VES @ talk "太好了，让我把东西准备好..."
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:20
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_1bb29bdd:

    # "Over the next hour or so, 维斯 and I began to set up some primitive defences around her camp."
    "在接下来的一个小时左右，维斯和我开始在她的营地周围设置一些原始的防御措施。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:22
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_c0c4d85f:

    # "A few spikes in the ground here and there alongside a wire running the camp’s perimeter..."
    "地上到处插着一些尖刺，还有一根电线环绕着营地的周边..."
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:24
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_96d5e6db:

    # "If someone knocked it with their foot, it would jingle the attached glass bottles and miscellaneous goods loudly enough to alert 维斯 of their presence."
    "如果有人用脚碰到它，就会让附着的玻璃瓶和杂物叮当作响，声音大到足以提醒维斯他们的存在。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:26
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_840a3072:

    # "And God help them when it did."
    "而当它响起时，愿上帝保佑他们。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:27
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_d5275d4b:

    # "Wiping the sweat from my brow as I hammered in one of the posts and secured it in place, I noticed 维斯 sneakily watched me the whole time, still cautiously half alert to my presence as a human, and half with a great deal of curiosity."
    "当我锤入一根柱子并固定好它时，我擦去额头的汗水，注意到维斯一直在偷偷观察我，仍然对我作为人类的存在保持一半的警惕，另一半则充满了极大的好奇心。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:35
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_4d690972:

    # VES @ talk "You are strong."
    VES @ talk "你很强大。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:36
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_6fb5dd4e:

    # "She watched me force one of the wooden posts into the ground."
    "她看着我用力将一根木桩打入地面。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:37
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_3fcdb530:

    # MC @ talk "Yeah, when this {i}thing{/i} inside of me attached itself, it changed my body as well."
    MC @ talk "是的，当我体内的这个{i}东西{/i}附身时，它也改变了我的身体。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:38
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_aef1c638:

    # VES @ talk "... I see."
    VES @ talk "...明白了。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:41
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_ffbe6e66:

    # "维斯 continued to observe as I worked until the sun began to set. If I caught her staring, she quickly made sure to look away and carry on working elsewhere, usually coiling the wires around the posts."
    "维斯继续观察我工作，直到太阳开始落山。如果我抓到她在盯着看，她就会迅速移开视线，继续在别处工作，通常是绕着柱子卷电线。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:49
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_5278c1eb:

    # MC @ talk "Alright... That’s about everything, I think."
    MC @ talk "好了...我想差不多都完成了。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:50
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_ad5a8665:

    # VES @ talk "Yes, this is good."
    VES @ talk "是的，这很好。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_2_FortAndCook.rpy:51
translate zh rom_Ves_2_FortAndCook_101cd48e:

    # VES "..."
    VES "..."

